        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 1
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The sage studies a creature, attempting an @Check[arcana], @Check[nature], @Check[occultism], @Check[religion], or @Check[society] check against the creature's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge} DC. On a success, the sage gains a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls and AC against that creature and deals an additional 2d6 damage to the creature with weapon attacks.</p>\n<p>These benefits last for 1 minute or until the sage uses this ability again.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.pdEXnJrIHIEX9NM4]{Effect: Sage's Analysis}</p>"
